["function","Unset value for an offset\n\nUnsets a value for an offset.\n\nIf iteration is in progress, and ArrayIterator::offsetUnset is used to unset the current index of iteration, the iteration position will be advanced to the next index. Since the iteration position is also advanced at the end of a <literal>foreach<\/literal> loop body, use of ArrayIterator::offsetUnset inside a <literal>foreach<\/literal> loop may result in indices being skipped.",[["$key","mixed","The offset to unset."]],["void","No value is returned."],["ArrayIterator::offsetGet","ArrayIterator::offsetSet"]]
