["function","Maps a scalar to an enum instance\n\nThe from method translates a <type>string<\/type> or <type>int<\/type> into the corresponding Enum case, if any. If there is no matching case defined, it will throw a ValueError.",[["$value","int|string","The scalar value to map to an enum case."]],["static","A case instance of this enumeration."],["UnitEnum::cases","BackedEnum::tryFrom"]]
