["function","Save object to file\n\nSaves a copy of the object to the specified file.",[["$filename","string|null","The name of the file to which to save the object."],["$remember","bool","Indicates whether the <parameter>filename<\/parameter> parameter is to be used as the current working file. If <type>true<\/type>, <parameter>filename<\/parameter> becomes the current file and the object is supposed to clear its dirty flag after the save. If <type>false<\/type>, this save operation is a \"Save A Copy As ...\" operation. In this case, the current file is unchanged and the object is not supposed to clear its dirty flag."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success or <type>false<\/type> on failure."]]
