["constant","Indicates whether SHA-512 hashes are supported in <function>crypt<\/function>. Always <literal>1<\/literal>."]
["constant","Indicates whether standard DES-based hashes are supported in <function>crypt<\/function>. Always <literal>1<\/literal>."]
