["function","Returns the result of applying a callback to each value\n\nReturns the result of applying a <parameter>callback<\/parameter> function to each value in the sequence.",[["$callback","callable","callback(<type>mixed<\/type> <parameter>value<\/parameter>): <type>mixed<\/type>\n\nA <type>callable<\/type> to apply to each value in the sequence.\n\nThe callable should return what the new value will be in the new sequence."]],["Ds\\Sequence","The result of applying a <parameter>callback<\/parameter> to each value in the sequence.\n\nThe values of the current instance won't be affected."]]
