["function","Rotates the sequence by a given number of rotations\n\nRotates the sequence by a given number of rotations, which is equivalent to successively calling $sequence->push($sequence->shift()) if the number of rotations is positive, or $sequence->unshift($sequence->pop()) if negative.",[["$rotations","int","The number of times the sequence should be rotated."]],["void","No value is returned.. The sequence of the current instance will be rotated."]]
