["function","Creates a new set using values that aren't in another set\n\nCreates a new set using values that aren't in another set.\n\nA \\ B = {x ∈ A | x ∉ B}",[["$set","Ds\\Set","Set containing the values to exclude."]],["Ds\\Set","A new set containing all values that were not in the other <parameter>set<\/parameter>."],["Complement on Wikipedia"]]
["function","Creates a new set using a callable to\n    determine which values to include\n\nCreates a new set using a <type>callable<\/type> to determine which values to include.",[["$callback","callable","callback(<type>mixed<\/type> <parameter>value<\/parameter>): <type>bool<\/type>\n\nOptional <type>callable<\/type> which returns <type>true<\/type> if the value should be included, <type>false<\/type> otherwise.\n\nIf a callback is not provided, only values which are <type>true<\/type> (see converting to boolean) will be included."]],["Ds\\Set","A new set containing all the values for which either the <parameter>callback<\/parameter> returned <type>true<\/type>, or all values that convert to <type>true<\/type> if a <parameter>callback<\/parameter> was not provided."]]
