["function","Creates a new set by intersecting values with another set\n\nCreates a new set using values common to both the current instance and another <parameter>set<\/parameter>. In other words, returns a copy of the current instance with all values removed that are not in the other <parameter>set<\/parameter>.\n\nA ∩ B = {x : x ∈ A ∧ x ∈ B}",[["$set","Ds\\Set","The other set."]],["Ds\\Set","The intersection of the current instance and another <parameter>set<\/parameter>."],["Intersection on Wikipedia"]]
