["function","Creates a new set using values from the current instance and another set\n\nCreates a new set that contains the values of the current instance as well as the values of another <parameter>set<\/parameter>.\n\nA ∪ B = {x: x ∈ A ∨ x ∈ B}",[["$set","Ds\\Set","The other set, to combine with the current instance."]],["Ds\\Set","A new set containing all the values of the current instance as well as another <parameter>set<\/parameter>."],["Union on Wikipedia"]]
