["function","Configures the watcher\n\nConfigures the EvIo watcher",[["$fd","mixed","The same as for EvIo::__construct"],["$events","int","The same as for EvIo::__construct"]],["void","No value is returned."]]
["class","Represents an event loop that is always distinct from the default loop. Unlike the default loop, it cannot handle <classname>EvChild<\/classname> watchers.\n\nHaving threads we have to create a loop per thread, and use the default loop in the parent thread.\n\nThe default event loop is initialized automatically by Ev. It is accessible via methods of the <classname>Ev<\/classname> class, or via EvLoop::defaultLoop method."]
