["function","Detects whether event is pending or scheduled\n\nDetects whether event is pending or scheduled",[["$flags","int","One of, or a composition of the following constants: <constant>Event::READ<\/constant>, <constant>Event::WRITE<\/constant>, <constant>Event::TIMEOUT<\/constant>, <constant>Event::SIGNAL<\/constant>."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> if event is pending or scheduled. Otherwise <type>false<\/type>."]]
["function","Re-configures event\n\nRe-configures event. Note, this function doesn't invoke obsolete libevent's event_set. It calls event_assign instead.",[["$base","EventBase","The event base to associate the event with."],["$fd","mixed","Stream resource, socket resource, or numeric file descriptor. For timer events pass <constant>-1<\/constant>. For signal events pass the signal number, e.g. <constant>SIGHUP<\/constant>."],["$what","int","See Event flags."],["$cb","callable","The event callback. See Event callbacks."],["$arg","mixed","Custom data associated with the event. It will be passed to the callback when the event becomes active."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success or <type>false<\/type> on failure."]]
