["function","Returns underlying input buffer associated with current buffer\n  event\n\nReturns underlying input buffer associated with current buffer event. An input buffer is a storage for data to read.\n\nNote, there is also <literal>input<\/literal> property of <classname>EventBufferEvent<\/classname> class.",null,["EventBuffer","Returns instance of <classname>EventBuffer<\/classname> input buffer associated with current buffer event."],["EventBufferEvent::getOutput"]]
