["function","Constructs EventDnsBase object\n\nConstructs EventDnsBase object.",[["$base","mixed","Event base."],["$initialize","mixed",["If <parameter>initialize<\/parameter> is <type>true<\/type>, it attempts to use the underlying operating system defaults to configure the DNS base sensibly. If it is <type>false<\/type>, the DNS base is left unconfigured, with no nameservers or options set. In the latter case the DNS base should be configured manually, e.g. with EventDnsBase::parseResolvConf.","If <parameter>initialize<\/parameter> is an integer, it must be one of the following flags:",{"type":"table","title":"","headers":["Flag","Description"],"rows":[["<constant>EventDnsBase::DISABLE_WHEN_INACTIVE<\/constant>","Do not prevent the libevent event loop from exiting when we have no active DNS requests."],["<constant>EventDnsBase::INITIALIZE_NAMESERVERS<\/constant>","Process the <literal>resolv.conf<\/literal>."],["<constant>EventDnsBase::NAMESERVERS_NO_DEFAULT<\/constant>","Do not add default nameserver if there are no nameservers in the <literal>resolv.conf<\/literal>."]]}]]]]
