["function","Returns EventBufferEvent object\n\nReturns <classname>EventBufferEvent<\/classname> object which represents buffer event that the connection is using.\n\nThe reference counter of the returned object will be incremented by one to protect internal structures against premature destruction when the method is called from a user callback. So the <classname>EventBufferEvent<\/classname> object should be freed explicitly with EventBufferEvent::free method. Otherwise memory will leak.",null,["EventBufferEvent","Returns <classname>EventBufferEvent<\/classname> object."],["EventHttpRequest::getConnection"]]
