["function","The setCallback purpose\n\nAdjust event connect listener's callback and optionally the callback argument.",[["$cb","callable","The new callback for new connections. Ignored if <type>null<\/type>.\n\nShould match the following prototype:\n\ncallback(<type>EventListener<\/type> <parameter>listener<\/parameter>, <type>mixed<\/type> <parameter>fd<\/parameter>, <type>array<\/type> <parameter>address<\/parameter>, <type>mixed<\/type> <parameter>arg<\/parameter>): <type>void<\/type>\n\n<parameter>listener<\/parameter> — The <classname>EventListener<\/classname> object.\n\n<parameter>fd<\/parameter> — The file descriptor or a resource associated with the listener.\n\n<parameter>address<\/parameter> — Array of two elements: IP address and the server port.\n\n<parameter>arg<\/parameter> — User custom data attached to the callback."],["$arg","mixed","Custom user data attached to the callback. Ignored if <type>null<\/type>."]],["void","No value is returned."]]
