["constant","Stop criterion is number of bits that fail. The number of bits means the number of output neurons which differ more than the bit fail limit (see fann_get_bit_fail_limit, fann_set_bit_fail_limit). The bits are counted in all of the training data, so this number can be higher than the number of training data."]
