["function","Creates a new image as a copy\n\nCreates a new image that is a copy of an existing one with the image pixels \"imploded\" by the specified percentage.",[["$radius","float","The radius of the implode."]],["mixed","Returns imploded <classname>Gmagick<\/classname> object."]]
