["function","Gets the horizontal and vertical sampling factor\n\nGets the horizontal and vertical sampling factor.",null,["array","Returns an associative array with the horizontal and vertical sampling factors of the image."]]
["function","Returns the size associated with the Imagick object\n\nGet the size in pixels associated with the Imagick object, previously set by <function>Imagick::setSize<\/function>.\n\nThis method just returns the size that was set using <function>Imagick::setSize<\/function>. If you want to get the actual width \/ height of the image, use <function>Imagick::getImageWidth<\/function> and <function>Imagick::getImageHeight<\/function>.",null,["array","Returns the size associated with the Imagick object as an array with the keys \"columns\" and \"rows\"."]]
