["function","Returns the ImageMagick API version\n\nReturns the ImageMagick API version as a string and as a number.",null,["array","Returns the ImageMagick API version as a string and as a number."]]
["function","Replaces colors in the image\n\nReplaces colors in the image using a Hald lookup table. Hald images can be created using HALD color coder.",[["$clut","Imagick","Imagick object containing the Hald lookup image."],["$channel","int","Provide any channel constant that is valid for your channel mode. To apply to more than one channel, combine channel constants using bitwise operators. Defaults to <constant>Imagick::CHANNEL_DEFAULT<\/constant>. Refer to this list of channel constants"]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success."]]
