["function","Paints pixels transparent\n\nPaints pixels matching the target color transparent. This method is available if Imagick has been compiled against ImageMagick version 6.3.8 or newer.",[["$target","mixed","The target color to paint"],["$alpha","float","The level of transparency: 1.0 is fully opaque and 0.0 is fully transparent."],["$fuzz","float","The amount of fuzz. For example, set fuzz to 10 and the color red at intensities of 100 and 102 respectively are now interpreted as the same color."],["$invert","bool","If <type>true<\/type> paints any pixel that does not match the target color."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success."]]
