["function","Remove edges from the image\n\nRemove edges that are the background color from the image. This method is available if Imagick has been compiled against ImageMagick version 6.2.9 or newer.",[["$fuzz","float","By default target must match a particular pixel color exactly. However, in many cases two colors may differ by a small amount. The fuzz member of image defines how much tolerance is acceptable to consider two colors as the same. This parameter represents the variation on the quantum range."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success."],["<function>Imagick::getQuantumDepth<\/function>","<function>Imagick::getQuantumRange<\/function>","<function>imagecropauto<\/function>"]]
