["function","Indicates that subsequent commands up to a ImagickDraw::opPattern() command comprise the definition of a named pattern\n\nThis function is currently not documented; only its argument list is available.\n\nIndicates that subsequent commands up to a DrawPopPattern() command comprise the definition of a named pattern. The pattern space is assigned top left corner coordinates, a width and height, and becomes its own drawing space. Anything which can be drawn may be used in a pattern definition. Named patterns may be used as stroke or brush definitions.",[["$pattern_id","string","the pattern Id"],["$x","float","x coordinate of the top-left corner"],["$y","float","y coordinate of the top-left corner"],["$width","float","width of the pattern"],["$height","float","height of the pattern"]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success or <type>false<\/type> on failure."]]
