["function","Sets the normalized HSL color\n\nSets the color described by the ImagickPixel object using normalized values for hue, saturation and luminosity.",[["$hue","float","The normalized value for hue, described as a fractional arc (between 0 and 1) of the hue circle, where the zero value is red."],["$saturation","float","The normalized value for saturation, with 1 as full saturation."],["$luminosity","float","The normalized value for luminosity, on a scale from black at 0 to white at 1, with the full HS value at 0.5 luminosity."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success."]]
