["constant","Uses a short list format, typically using abbreviations."]
["constant","Uses the widest (most verbose) list format, typically with conjunctions spelled out in full."]
["function","Creates a new IntlListFormatter instance\n\nCreates a new <classname>IntlListFormatter<\/classname> instance for the given locale.",[["$locale","mixed","The locale to use for formatting."],["$type","mixed","The list type. One of the <constant>IntlListFormatter::TYPE_*<\/constant> constants: <constant>IntlListFormatter::TYPE_AND<\/constant>, <constant>IntlListFormatter::TYPE_OR<\/constant>, or <constant>IntlListFormatter::TYPE_UNITS<\/constant>."],["$width","mixed","The list width. One of the <constant>IntlListFormatter::WIDTH_*<\/constant> constants: <constant>IntlListFormatter::WIDTH_WIDE<\/constant>, <constant>IntlListFormatter::WIDTH_SHORT<\/constant>, or <constant>IntlListFormatter::WIDTH_NARROW<\/constant>."]],null,["IntlListFormatter::format"]]
