["class","Objects of this class can be obtained from <classname>IntlBreakIterator<\/classname> objects. While the break iterators provide a sequence of boundary positions when iterated, <classname>IntlPartsIterator<\/classname> objects provide, as a convenience, the text fragments comprehended between two successive boundaries.\n\nThe keys may represent the offset of the left boundary, right boundary, or they may just the sequence of non-negative integers. See <function>IntlBreakIterator::getPartsIterator<\/function>."]
