["class","Represents a BSON date. The value is a 64-bit integer that represents the number of milliseconds since the Unix epoch (Jan 1, 1970). Negative values represent dates before 1970."]
["function","Construct a new UTCDateTime",[["$milliseconds","int|MongoDB\\BSON\\Int64|DateTimeInterface|null","Number of milliseconds since the Unix epoch (Jan 1, 1970). Negative values represent dates before 1970. This value may be provided as a 64-bit <type>int<\/type>. For compatibility on 32-bit systems, this parameter may also be provided as a <classname>MongoDB\\BSON\\Int64<\/classname>.\n\nIf the argument is a <classname>DateTimeInterface<\/classname>, the number of milliseconds since the Unix epoch will be derived from that value.\n\nIf this argument is <type>null<\/type>, the current time will be used by default."]],null,["BSON Types: Date"]]
["function","Returns the string representation of this UTCDateTime",null,["string","Returns the string representation of this UTCDateTime."],["BSON Types: Date"]]
["function","Returns a representation that can be converted to JSON",null,["mixed","Returns data which can be serialized by <function>json_encode<\/function> to produce an extended JSON representation of the <classname>MongoDB\\BSON\\UTCDateTime<\/classname>.\n\nThe output is consistent with the <function>MongoDB\\BSON\\toJSON<\/function> function, which uses the driver-specific legacy extended JSON format. This does not necessarily match the relaxed or canonical extended JSON representations used by <function>MongoDB\\BSON\\toRelaxedExtendedJSON<\/function> and <function>MongoDB\\BSON\\toCanonicalExtendedJSON<\/function>, respectively."],["JsonSerializable::jsonSerialize","<function>json_encode<\/function>","<function>MongoDB\\BSON\\toCanonicalExtendedJSON<\/function>","<function>MongoDB\\BSON\\toRelaxedExtendedJSON<\/function>","MongoDB Extended JSON"]]
["function","Returns the DateTime representation of this UTCDateTime",null,["DateTime","Returns the <classname>DateTime<\/classname> representation of this UTCDateTime. The returned <classname>DateTime<\/classname> will use the UTC time zone."],["MongoDB\\BSON\\UTCDateTime::toDateTimeImmutable","BSON Types: Date"]]
["function","Returns the DateTimeImmutable representation of this UTCDateTime",null,["DateTimeImmutable","Returns the <classname>DateTimeImmutable<\/classname> representation of this UTCDateTime. The returned <classname>DateTimeImmutable<\/classname> will use the UTC time zone."],["MongoDB\\BSON\\UTCDateTime::toDateTime","BSON Types: Date"]]
