["function","Returns the DateTimeImmutable representation of this UTCDateTimeInterface",null,["DateTimeImmutable","Returns the <classname>DateTimeImmutable<\/classname> representation of this UTCDateTimeInterface. The returned <classname>DateTimeImmutable<\/classname> will use the UTC time zone."],["MongoDB\\BSON\\UTCDateTime::toDateTimeImmutable"]]
