["function","Returns the command's request ID\n\nThe request ID is generated by the extension and may be used to associate this <classname>MongoDB\\Driver\\Monitoring\\CommandFailedEvent<\/classname> with a previous <classname>MongoDB\\Driver\\Monitoring\\CommandStartedEvent<\/classname>.",null,["string","Returns the command's request ID."],["MongoDB\\Driver\\Monitoring\\CommandStartedEvent::getRequestId",""]]
