["function","Returns the server connection ID for the command\n\nReturns the server connection ID for the command. The server connection ID is distinct from server (i.e. <function>MongoDB\\Driver\\Monitoring\\CommandFailedEvent::getServer<\/function>) and is returned in the \"connectionId\" field of a <literal>hello<\/literal> command response MongoDB 4.2+.",null,["int|null","Returns the server connection ID, or <type>null<\/type> if it is not available."]]
