["constant","This connection attribute controls the format of strings for datetime types. When this is <type>false<\/type>, PDO_DBLIB will return a datetime type as a string in the format that SQL Server returns it in (i.e. <literal>\"2017-10-27 10:22:44\"<\/literal>). When <type>true<\/type>, PDO_DBLIB will convert the datetime type into a string using a user-defined or locale format, as specified in the FreeTDS locales.conf file. By default, this attribute is <type>false<\/type>."]
