["constant","A list of one or more permissible ciphers to use for SSL encryption, in a format understood by OpenSSL. For example: <literal>DHE-RSA-AES256-SHA:AES128-SHA<\/literal>\n\nCan only be used in the <parameter>driver_options<\/parameter> array when constructing a new database handle."]
["constant","The file path to the SSL key.\n\nCan only be used in the <parameter>driver_options<\/parameter> array when constructing a new database handle."]
