["constant",["This option controls whether the ODBC cursor library is used. The ODBC cursor library supports some advanced ODBC features (e.g. block scrollable cursors), which may not be implemented by the driver. The following values are supported: <constant>Pdo\\Odbc::SQL_USE_IF_NEEDED<\/constant> — Use the ODBC cursor library when needed. This is the default. <constant>Pdo\\Odbc::SQL_USE_DRIVER<\/constant> — Never use the ODBC cursor library. <constant>Pdo\\Odbc::SQL_USE_ODBC<\/constant> — Always use the ODBC cursor library.","Use the ODBC cursor library when needed. This is the default.","Never use the ODBC cursor library.","Always use the ODBC cursor library."]]
