["constant","The Service-Type attribute. The attribute value indicates the service type the user is requesting, and is expected to be an <type>int<\/type>, which can be set using <function>radius_put_int<\/function>.\n\nA number of constants are provided to represent the possible values of this attribute. They include: <constant>RADIUS_LOGIN<\/constant><constant>RADIUS_FRAMED<\/constant><constant>RADIUS_CALLBACK_LOGIN<\/constant><constant>RADIUS_CALLBACK_FRAMED<\/constant><constant>RADIUS_OUTBOUND<\/constant><constant>RADIUS_ADMINISTRATIVE<\/constant><constant>RADIUS_NAS_PROMPT<\/constant><constant>RADIUS_AUTHENTICATE_ONLY<\/constant><constant>RADIUS_CALLBACK_NAS_PROMPT<\/constant>"]
