["function","Gets an array of methods\n\nGets an array of methods for the class.",[["$filter","int|null","Filter the results to include only methods with certain attributes. Defaults to no filtering.\n\nAny bitwise disjunction of <constant>ReflectionMethod::IS_STATIC<\/constant>, <constant>ReflectionMethod::IS_PUBLIC<\/constant>, <constant>ReflectionMethod::IS_PROTECTED<\/constant>, <constant>ReflectionMethod::IS_PRIVATE<\/constant>, <constant>ReflectionMethod::IS_ABSTRACT<\/constant>, <constant>ReflectionMethod::IS_FINAL<\/constant>, so that all methods with any of the given attributes will be returned.\n\nNote that other bitwise operations, for instance <literal>~<\/literal> will not work as expected. In other words, it is not possible to retrieve all non-static methods, for example."]],["array","An <type>array<\/type> of <classname>ReflectionMethod<\/classname> objects reflecting each method."],["ReflectionClass::getMethod","<function>get_class_methods<\/function>"]]
