["function","Forces initialization of a lazy object\n\nForces initialization of the specified <parameter>object<\/parameter>. This method has no effect if the object is not lazy or has already been initialized. Otherwise, initialization proceeds as described in the Initialization Sequence.\n\nIn most cases, calling this method is unnecessary, as lazy objects initialize themselves automatically when their state is observed or modified.",[["$object","object","The object to initialize."]],["object","If <parameter>object<\/parameter> is a lazy proxy, returns its real instance. Otherwise, returns <parameter>object<\/parameter> itself."],["Lazy objects","ReflectionClass::newLazyGhost","ReflectionClass::markLazyObjectAsInitialized","ReflectionClass::isUninitializedLazyObject"]]
