["function","Get the file name of the current execution point\n\nReturns the full path and file name of the current execution point in the reflected <classname>Fiber<\/classname>. If the fiber has not been started or has terminated, an <classname>Error<\/classname> is thrown.",null,["string|null","The full path and file name of the reflected fiber. If the reflected fiber is used outside a user-defined function, <type>null<\/type> is returned."]]
