["function","Set raw property value without triggering lazy initialization\n\nSets (changes) the property's value without triggering lazy initialization and without calling hook functions. The property is marked as non-lazy and can be accessed afterwards without triggering lazy initialization. The property must not be dynamic, static, or virtual, and the object must be an instance of a user defined class or <classname>stdClass<\/classname>.\n\nIf this was the last lazy property, the object is marked as non-lazy and the initializer or factory function is detached.",[["$object","object","The object to change the property on."],["$value","mixed","The new value."]],["void","No value is returned."],["Lazy objects","ReflectionProperty::skipLazyInitialization","ReflectionClass::newLazyGhost"]]
