["function","Deletes by Ids\n\nDeletes a collection of documents with the specified set of ids.",[["$ids","array","An array of IDs representing the uniqueKey field declared in the schema for each document to be deleted. This must be an actual php variable."]],["SolrUpdateResponse","Returns a <type>SolrUpdateResponse<\/type> on success and throws an exception on failure."],["SolrClient::deleteById","SolrClient::deleteByQuery","SolrClient::deleteByQueries"]]
