["function","Gets file type\n\nReturns the type of the file referenced.",null,["string|false","A <type>string<\/type> representing the type of the entry. May be one of <literal>file<\/literal>, <literal>link<\/literal>, <literal>dir<\/literal>, <literal>block<\/literal>, <literal>fifo<\/literal>, <literal>char<\/literal>, <literal>socket<\/literal>, or <literal>unknown<\/literal>, or <type>false<\/type> on failure."]]
