["function","Retrieve current line of file\n\nRetrieves the current line of the file.",null,["string|array|false","Retrieves the current line of the file. If the <constant>SplFileObject::READ_CSV<\/constant> flag is set, this method returns an array containing the current line parsed as CSV data. If the end of the file is reached, <type>false<\/type> is returned."],["SplFileObject::key","SplFileObject::seek","SplFileObject::next","SplFileObject::rewind","SplFileObject::valid"]]
