["function","Set the checks to run\n\nSets the checks that will be performed by SpoofChecker::isSuspicious.",[["$checks","int","The checks that will be performed by SpoofChecker::isSuspicious. A bitmask of <constant>Spoofchecker::SINGLE_SCRIPT_CONFUSABLE<\/constant>, <constant>Spoofchecker::MIXED_SCRIPT_CONFUSABLE<\/constant>, <constant>Spoofchecker::WHOLE_SCRIPT_CONFUSABLE<\/constant>, <constant>Spoofchecker::ANY_CASE<\/constant>, <constant>Spoofchecker::SINGLE_SCRIPT<\/constant>, <constant>Spoofchecker::INVISIBLE<\/constant>, or <constant>Spoofchecker::CHAR_LIMIT<\/constant>. Defaults to all checks as of ICU 58; prior to that version, <constant>Spoofchecker::SINGLE_SCRIPT<\/constant> was excluded."]],["void","No value is returned."]]
["function","Set the restriction level\n\nSets the restriction level of SpoofChecker::isSuspicious.",[["$level","int","The restriction level of SpoofChecker::isSuspicious. One of <constant>Spoofchecker::ASCII<\/constant>, <constant>Spoofchecker::SINGLE_SCRIPT_RESTRICTIVE<\/constant>, <constant>Spoofchecker::HIGHLY_RESTRICTIVE<\/constant>, <constant>Spoofchecker::MODERATELY_RESTRICTIVE<\/constant>, <constant>Spoofchecker::MINIMALLY_RESTRICTIVE<\/constant>, or <constant>Spoofchecker::UNRESTRICTIVE<\/constant>. Defaults to <constant>Spoofchecker::HIGHLY_RESTRICTIVE<\/constant>."]],["void","No value is returned."]]
