["function","Retrieve a response body block\n\nRetrieve the content of a response body block.",[["$key","string","The content key. If not specified, the DEFAULT_BODY block is used; pass <type>null<\/type> to get all content blocks as an array."]],["mixed","The content string, or an array of all content blocks when <parameter>key<\/parameter> is <type>null<\/type>. Returns an empty string if the block is not set."],["Yaf_Response_Abstract::setBody","Yaf_Response_Abstract::appendBody","Yaf_Response_Abstract::prependBody","Yaf_Response_Abstract::clearBody"]]
["function","Retrieve an HTTP response header\n\nRetrieve an HTTP response header.\n\nThis method is only fully implemented in the <classname>Yaf_Response_Http<\/classname> subclass. In the abstract class it is a stub.",[["$name","string","The header name. If omitted, all headers are returned as an array."]],["string|array|null","The header value as a string, or an array of all headers when the name is omitted. Returns <type>null<\/type> if the requested header is not set."],["Yaf_Response_Abstract::setHeader","Yaf_Response_Abstract::clearHeaders","Yaf_Response_Abstract::setAllHeaders"]]
