["function","Enable\/disable quorum endpoint order randomization\n\nIf passed a true value, will make the client connect to quorum peers in the order as specified in the zookeeper_init() call. A false value causes zookeeper_init() to permute the peer endpoints which is good for more even client connection distribution among the quorum peers. ZooKeeper C Client uses false by default.",[["$yesOrNo","bool","Disable\/enable quorum endpoint order randomization."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success or <type>false<\/type> on failure."],["Zookeeper::__construct","Zookeeper::connect","<classname>ZookeeperException<\/classname>"]]
