["function","Get the total number of neurons in the entire network\n\nGet the total number of neurons in the entire network. This number does also include the bias neurons, so a 2-4-2 network has 2+4+2 +2(bias) = 10 neurons.",[["$ann","resource","Neural network <type>resource<\/type>."]],["int","Total number of neurons in the entire network, or <type>false<\/type> on error."]]
