["function","Get the appearance of a field\n\nGets the appearance of a <parameter>field<\/parameter> (i.e. the value of the \/AP key) and stores it in a file.",[["$fdf_document","resource","The FDF document handle, returned by <function>fdf_create<\/function>, <function>fdf_open<\/function> or <function>fdf_open_string<\/function>."],["$field","string",""],["$face","int","The possible values are <constant>FDFNormalAP<\/constant>, <constant>FDFRolloverAP<\/constant> and <constant>FDFDownAP<\/constant>."],["$filename","string","The appearance will be stored in this parameter."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success or <type>false<\/type> on failure."]]
["function","Extracts uploaded file embedded in the FDF\n\nExtracts a file uploaded by means of the \"file selection\" field <parameter>fieldname<\/parameter> and stores it under <parameter>savepath<\/parameter>.",[["$fdf_document","resource","The FDF document handle, returned by <function>fdf_create<\/function>, <function>fdf_open<\/function> or <function>fdf_open_string<\/function>."],["$fieldname","string",""],["$savepath","string","May be the name of a plain file or an existing directory in which the file is to be created under its original name. Any existing file under the same name will be overwritten.\n\nThere seems to be no other way to find out the original filename but to store the file using a directory as <parameter>savepath<\/parameter> and check for the basename it was stored under."]],["array","The returned array contains the following fields: <parameter>path<\/parameter> - path where the file got stored<parameter>size<\/parameter> - size of the stored file in bytes<parameter>type<\/parameter> - mimetype if given in the FDF"]]
