["function","Gets version number for FDF API or file\n\nReturn the FDF version for the given document, or the toolkit API version number if no parameter is given.",[["$fdf_document","resource","The FDF document handle, returned by <function>fdf_create<\/function>, <function>fdf_open<\/function> or <function>fdf_open_string<\/function>."]],["string","Returns the version as a string. For the current FDF toolkit 5.0 the API version number is <literal>5.0<\/literal> and the document version number is either <literal>1.2<\/literal>, <literal>1.3<\/literal> or <literal>1.4<\/literal>."],["<function>fdf_set_version<\/function>"]]
