["function","Read a FDF document from a string\n\nReads form data from a string.\n\nYou can use <function>fdf_open_string<\/function> together with $HTTP_FDF_DATA to process FDF form input from a remote client.",[["$fdf_data","string","The data as returned from a PDF form or created using <function>fdf_create<\/function> and <function>fdf_save_string<\/function>."]],["resource","Returns a FDF document handle, or <type>false<\/type> on error."],["<function>fdf_open<\/function>","<function>fdf_close<\/function>","<function>fdf_create<\/function>","<function>fdf_save_string<\/function>"]]
