["function","Translate a timezone identifier to its IANA equivalent\n\nObject-oriented style (method):\n\nProcedural style:\n\nTranslates a timezone identifier to its IANA equivalent. For example, <literal>\"GMT\"<\/literal> returns <literal>\"Etc\/GMT\"<\/literal>, and <literal>\"US\/Eastern\"<\/literal> returns <literal>\"America\/New_York\"<\/literal>.\n\nThis function requires ICU version >= 74.",[["$timezoneId","string","The timezone identifier to translate."]],["string|false","Returns the IANA timezone identifier as a <type>string<\/type>, or <type>false<\/type> on failure."],["<function>intltz_get_id_for_windows_id<\/function>","<function>intltz_get_windows_id<\/function>","<function>intltz_create_time_zone<\/function>"]]
