["function","Translate a Windows timezone into a system timezone\n\nObject-oriented style (method):\n\nProcedural style:\n\nTranslates a Windows timezone (e.g. \"Pacific Standard Time\") into a system timezone (e.g. \"America\/Los_Angeles\").\n\nThis function requires ICU version ≥ 52.\n\nThis function is currently not documented; only its argument list is available.",[["$timezoneId","string",""],["$region","string|null",""]],["string|false","Returns the system timezone or <type>false<\/type> on failure."],["IntlTimeZone::getWindowsID"]]
