["function","Translate a system timezone into a Windows timezone\n\nObject-oriented style (method):\n\nProcedural style:\n\nTranslates a system timezone (e.g. \"America\/Los_Angeles\") into a Windows timezone (e.g. \"Pacific Standard Time\").\n\nThis function requires ICU version ≥ 52.\n\nThis function is currently not documented; only its argument list is available.",[["$timezoneId","string",""]],["string|false","Returns the Windows timezone or <type>false<\/type> on failure."],["IntlTimeZone::getIDForWindowsID"]]
