["function","Determines if a point on the ristretto255 curve\n\nDetermines if a point on the ristretto255 curve, in canonical form, on the main subgroup, and that the point doesn't have a small order. Available as of libsodium 1.0.18.\n\nThis function is currently not documented; only its argument list is available.",[["$s","string","An Elliptic-curve point."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> if <parameter>s<\/parameter> is on the ristretto255 curve, <type>false<\/type> otherwise."],["<function>sodium_crypto_core_ristretto255_scalar_random<\/function>","<function>sodium_crypto_scalarmult_ristretto255_base<\/function>"]]
