["function","Decrypt a chunk of data from an encrypted stream\n\nDecrypt a chunk of data from an encrypted stream.",[["$state","string","See <function>sodium_crypto_secretstream_xchacha20poly1305_init_pull<\/function> and <function>sodium_crypto_secretstream_xchacha20poly1305_init_push<\/function>"],["$ciphertext","string","The ciphertext chunk to decrypt."],["$additional_data","string","Optional additional data to include in the authentication tag."]],["array|false","An array with two values: <type>string<\/type>; The decrypted chunk <type>int<\/type>; An optional tag (if provided during push). Possible values: <constant>SODIUM_CRYPTO_SECRETSTREAM_XCHACHA20POLY1305_TAG_MESSAGE<\/constant>: the most common tag, that doesn't add any information about the nature of the message. <constant>SODIUM_CRYPTO_SECRETSTREAM_XCHACHA20POLY1305_TAG_FINAL<\/constant>: indicates that the message marks the end of the stream, and erases the secret key used to encrypt the previous sequence. <constant>SODIUM_CRYPTO_SECRETSTREAM_XCHACHA20POLY1305_TAG_PUSH<\/constant>: indicates that the message marks the end of a set of messages, but not the end of the stream. For example, a huge JSON string sent as multiple chunks can use this tag to indicate to the application that the string is complete and that it can be decoded. But the stream itself is not closed, and more data may follow. <constant>SODIUM_CRYPTO_SECRETSTREAM_XCHACHA20POLY1305_TAG_REKEY<\/constant>: \"forget\" the key used to encrypt this message and the previous ones, and derive a new secret key. "]]
["function","Encrypt a chunk of data so that it can safely be decrypted in a streaming API\n\nEncrypt a chunk of data so that it can safely be decrypted in a streaming API.",[["$state","string","See <function>sodium_crypto_secretstream_xchacha20poly1305_init_pull<\/function> and <function>sodium_crypto_secretstream_xchacha20poly1305_init_push<\/function>"],["$message","string",""],["$additional_data","string",""],["$tag","int","Optional. Can be used to assert decryption behavior (i.e. re-keying or indicating the final chunk in a stream)."]],["string","Returns the encrypted ciphertext."]]
