["function","Compute a short hash of a message and key\n\n<function>sodium_crypto_shorthash<\/function> wraps a hash function called SipHash-2-4, which is ideal for implementing hash tables that are not susceptible to hash collision denial of service attacks (Hash-DoS).\n\nSipHash-2-4 isn't a general purpose cryptographic hash function.",[["$message","string","The message to hash."],["$key","string","The hash key."]],["string",""]]
