["function","Deterministically derive the key pair from a single key\n\nClamps the seed to form a secret key, derives the public key, and returns the two as a keypair.\n\nThe <literal>*_seed_keypair<\/literal> functions are ideal for generating a keypair from a password and salt. Use the result as a <parameter>seed<\/parameter> to generate the desired keys.",[["$seed","string","Some cryptographic input. Must be 32 bytes."]],["string","Keypair (secret key and public key)"]]
