["function","Returns a timezone name by guessing from abbreviation and UTC offset",[["$abbr","string","Time zone abbreviation."],["$utcOffset","int","Offset from GMT in seconds. Defaults to -1 which means that first found time zone corresponding to <parameter>abbr<\/parameter> is returned. Otherwise exact offset is searched and only if not found then the first time zone with any offset is returned."],["$isDST","int","Daylight saving time indicator. Defaults to -1, which means that whether the time zone has daylight saving or not is not taken into consideration when searching. If this is set to 1, then the <parameter>utcOffset<\/parameter> is assumed to be an offset with daylight saving in effect; if 0, then <parameter>utcOffset<\/parameter> is assumed to be an offset without daylight saving in effect. If <parameter>abbr<\/parameter> doesn't exist then the time zone is searched solely by the <parameter>utcOffset<\/parameter> and <parameter>isDST<\/parameter>."]],["string|false","Returns time zone name on success or <type>false<\/type> on failure."],["<function>timezone_abbreviations_list<\/function>"]]
