["function","Open a directory entry for reading\n\nOpens a directory entry in a zip file for reading.",[["$zip_dp","resource","A valid resource handle returned by <function>zip_open<\/function>."],["$zip_entry","resource","A directory entry returned by <function>zip_read<\/function>."],["$mode","string","Any of the modes specified in the documentation of <function>fopen<\/function>.\n\nCurrently, <parameter>mode<\/parameter> is ignored and is always <literal>\"rb\"<\/literal>. This is due to the fact that zip support in PHP is read only access."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success or <type>false<\/type> on failure.\n\nUnlike <function>fopen<\/function> and other similar functions, the return value of <function>zip_entry_open<\/function> only indicates the result of the operation and is not needed for reading or closing the directory entry."],["<function>zip_entry_close<\/function>","<function>zip_entry_read<\/function>"]]
